 "notes": [
  "Posted 3 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section; the strategy says 'you start with SQUADRON ASSIGMENTS, STRIKE PLANNING and THE SHIELD IS DOWN' (with Heading For The Medical Frigate in the Interrupts). All are counted in the 60. Three Effects start and the post names none as the HFTMF Effect, so starting.effect is not set.",
  "Section headers (Objective / Events, Weapons / Devices, Starships / Vehicles) mis-parsed as cards were removed; total is 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Endor' dested the Light Endor system; 'Weapon levitation' dested the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt Weapon Levitation (Jabba's Palace); 'The shield is down' dested the Tatooine Effect The Shield Is Down!; 'Projection of Skywalker' dested Projection Of A Skywalker; 'Squadron Assigments' dested Squadron Assignments; 'Chewbacca of Kashyyk' dested Chewbacca Of Kashyyyk; 'Don't get @#$%y' dested Don't Get Cocky; 'Run Luke, Run' dested Run Luke, Run!; 'Endor Rebel Landing Site' dested Endor: Rebel Landing Site (Forest).",
  "Posted 'Obi-Wan Kenobi' dested the Premiere Obi-Wan Kenobi: the strategy calls him 'a old Obi-wan ... whitout his lightsaber' and 'ben'.",
